      "effect": "raises",
      "severity": "medium",
      "title": "Cap on all orders changes the refund limit",
      "because": "refundableTotal no longer uses refundableLines(order) and now computes the limit as the lesser of the requested amount plus shipping and the remaining line value plus order.shippingTotal. The cap uses full shippingTotal and does not subtract shipping already refunded. A second refund could therefore return shipping again, up to the cap.",
      "why": "This is the limit that guards money paid out on every refund request.",
      "test": {
        "status": "partial",
        "note": "The cap test covers a first refund with prior line refunds, not repeated shipping refunds.",
